<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended Aug 23, compared with the Aug 16 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.18 vs 5.10</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............5.02 vs 5.03</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.40 vs 5.40</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.29 vs 5.31</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.37 vs 5.39</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.38 vs 5.38</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.84 vs 6.77</p>
</text>
